  "details": "WebKitGTK is the port of the portable web rendering engine WebKit to the GTK platform.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * chromium-browser: skia: chromium-browser: skia: Use after free in Skia (CVE-2026-85049)\n  * chromium-browser: skia: Skia: Cross-origin data disclosure via use-after-free vulnerability (CVE-2026-91747)\n  * chromium-browser: skia: Skia in chromium-browser: Information disclosure via improper state validation (CVE-2026-91733)\n  * chromium-browser: skia: Google Chrome: Cross-origin data disclosure due to uninitialized resource in Skia (CVE-2026-91740)\n  * chromium-browser: skia: Google Chrome Skia: Cross-origin data disclosure via improper state validation (CVE-2026-93387)\n  * chromium-browser: skia: chromium-browser: Uninitialized resource in Skia (CVE-2026-102325)\n  * chromium-browser: skia: Integer overflow in Skia (CVE-2026-103629)\n  * chromium-browser: skia: Uninitialized resource in Skia (CVE-2026-106379)\n  * chromium-browser: skia: Out of bounds read in Skia (CVE-2026-106399)\n  * chromium-browser: skia: Memory corruption in Skia (CVE-2026-113106)\n  * chromium-browser: skia: Improper input validation in Skia (CVE-2026-118348)\n  * chromium-browser: skia: Memory corruption in Skia (CVE-2026-118351)\n  * chromium-browser: skia: Memory corruption in Skia (CVE-2026-118340)\n  * chromium-browser: skia: Improper input validation in Skia (CVE-2026-118354)\n  * chromium-browser: skia: Memory corruption in Skia (CVE-2026-118319)\n  * chromium-browser: skia: Use after free in Skia (CVE-2026-119271)\n  * chromium-browser: skia: Improper input validation in Skia (CVE-2026-119261)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
